{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfQLLrJ5ZyVTB8tdw9oo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic Memory is set up for this repo. The plugin wiring checks out, but proactive capture only starts after you restart the session.\n\n- **Project:** I used the existing `main` project, not a new `ms` one. Creating `ms` at `~/basic-memory/ms` failed because that path sits inside `main`'s directory. `main` was empty, so nothing was displaced.\n- **Profile:** Coding setup, with `repository` set to `ms`. There's no git remote, so I used the directory name as you said.\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task, since none existed. I re-read Coding Session and its `schema` and `settings` came back as nested objects, not strings.\n- **Placement:** The project was empty, so I suggested a light starting layout (`schemas/`, `decisions/`, `sessions/`, `tasks/`, `notes/`). It's stored as `placementConventions`.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills at user level. This isn't the skills' source repo, so nothing was overwritten.\n- **Settings:** I wrote them to `.claude/settings.local.json` (personal, not team). I chose personal because you didn't specify. I turned the output style on and event capture on.\n- **Smoke test:**\n  - The open-decision query ran cleanly with 0 results.\n  - The schema search returned all three schemas.\n  - `hook status` found the settings and reported project `main`, profile `coding` and capture on. It also showed 1 pending envelope, 0 archived and no flush yet, and \"checkpoint on compact: off\".\n\nThe \"checkpoint on compact: off\" line is worth a look. I set `preCompactCapture` to `extractive`, so I'd have expected it to be on. I didn't dig into why.\n\nRecall and the PreCompact hook work now. Restart Claude Code to get the output-style capture reflexes.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3833,"cache_read_input_tokens":32128,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3833},"output_tokens":663,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ce0f54f7-3a8c-4d27-973d-50cdc45fa8dc","uuid":"9fa3645f-342d-4264-adf1-9aa3f706d476","timestamp":"2026-11-03T04:58:32.614Z","request_id":"req_011CgfQLLdepDd7RuhTMns67"}
